--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Runtime components that are NOT bundled
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Redrob Office does not ship an inference runtime or model weights. Both are
fetched by the user, from the upstream project, during onboarding:

  * llama.cpp (llama-server) is downloaded from the pinned GitHub release at
    https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases and extracted into the user's
    application data directory.

  * Qwen3.5 GGUF weights are downloaded from Hugging Face into the same location.

This matters for redistribution. Because these artifacts are neither bundled in
nor distributed with the installer, Redrob does not redistribute them, and the
obligations that would attach to redistributing them do not transfer to a Redrob
Office download. Users obtain them directly from the upstream distributors and
are bound by those projects' licenses, reproduced in summary below.

